WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.800
A helpful welcome begins with attention.

2
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:12.400
Greet the visitor, introduce yourself

3
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:16.000
and ask what they need today.

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Listen before suggesting an option.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.400
If the request is unclear,

6
00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:31.600
ask one short follow-up question.

7
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:38.400
Offer information you can verify

8
00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:47.600
and explain the next step
in plain language.

9
00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:02.600
Before the conversation ends,

10
00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:06.400
check that the visitor knows
what to do next.

11
00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:10.000
A confident service experience is built

12
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.800
through clarity, respect
and follow-through.
